# Cloudflare Pages redirects (ignored by GitHub Pages, which gets the
# meta-refresh page Astro's `redirects` config emits instead).
#
# /free-review was a second enquiry route competing with /contact for the same
# conversion. Its content now lives on /contact in full. A meta-refresh is all
# a static build can emit; this makes it a real 301 so link equity and any
# indexed result move properly.
/free-review     /contact/     301
/free-review/    /contact/     301
